+read that, and do exactly the opposite
+i.e. Why would you want to rebuild indexes with a lot of unused space?
+every bit counts
+;)
+the space will be reclaimed for like 10 minutes
+and then you'll have the same unused space..
+the index is not static..
+yes
+even selects will buff it around
+the only reason i can think of that would significantly improve with pctfree at say 50 is that you get less undo
