... aria does not drive the behavior
notes comments such as &quot; the people who are implementing svg tiny would be a problem.&quot;
jon gunderson of the university of illinois is working on some IE ARIA demos, as is charles chen, dev of FireVox
notes that its too bad &quot;the people&quot; weren't informed of the meeting being held in their names...
