Weed.
Why were you depressed in the beginning...?
/
All along it was a genetics thing, from my mum. But it only kinda... become something when issues started happening, like it started with this guy, I&apos;d loved him for 3 years and I was put through bullshit with him for three years, and that kinda broke the depression free and let it loose in my mind. And everything else just makes it worse.
