f139aba52f9fa1394b4034a7954b2220: so what do you plan to say if you get the &quot;how long with it be before there's a final rec for HTML5&quot; question?
I plan to focus on how authors can use features as soon as they are implemented and shipped in browsers
f139aba52f9fa1394b4034a7954b2220: also always worth pointing out that the record of implementation progress on parts of the spec is exceptional
that is, it's getting implemented at a much more rapid pace than just about any other spec-in-progress that anybody'd want to compare it with
